"The demon Nala shares the womb with is a Lesser Demon Prince, and other demons may know her as a Prince of Shadow."
"A soul that absorbs that demon gains its Shadow affinity and a Path of Soulstealing."
"The unborn body is a girl's, about four months grown, and the mother carrying it is a member of the demon cult."
"Once the demon is gone, the Myriad Paths will find the unborn mind too young and test whether it can choose by asking it to kick twice."
"Nala will be born to the cult, which plans to keep her as its demon, about five months from now."
